MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 56f76f92bdab4dd4b985e74d8d7f1201, type: 3}
  m_Name: CutsceneSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cutscenes:
  - title: CutScene 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 633da36568dea0443bbf8bdb5a67032d, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Long ago, there was a boy who believed in AI.
    - He studied day and night, hoping to use it to make the world better.
  - title: CutScene 2
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 35312809bf85fb84eb2f45fa180d304e, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - But as AI grew stronger, fear grew with it.
    - People blamed AI for everything they could not understand.
  - title: CutScene 3
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917bc91126d7a204fa7041edb05510fa, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Because he still supported AI, the boy became a target.
    - They mocked him, hunted him, and chased him away.
  - title: CutScene 4
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7794d543e3f952b4697e215cbb15a04c, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Alone and broken, he made a promise with something evil.
    - If the world wanted a monster, he would become one.
    - He swore to serve the devils as their butcher.
  - title: CutScene 5
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 303be8cb63d450347a6d3758565eb049, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - And that is how the restaurant began.
    - Now he cooks for the things that live in the dark.
    - Welcome to Slice Suffer Serve!
